    "def": "set \\(\\mu_0^{(a)}=\\mathbb E_{P_{0X}}[g_{\\beta_0}(Y_0,a,X)]\\), \\(\\kappa_0^{(a)}=\\mathbb E_{P_{0X}}[g_{\\beta_0}(Y_0,a,X)^2]\\), \\(m_1^{(a)}=\\mu_0^{(a)}\\), and \\(v_1^{(a)}=\\sigma^2\\kappa_0^{(a)}+\\tau^2\\); for \\(1\\le t<T\\), set \\(\\mu_t^{(a)}=\\mathbb E_{X\\sim P_X,Z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)}[g_{\\beta_0}(m_t^{(a)}+\\sqrt{v_t^{(a)}}Z,a,X)]\\), \\(\\kappa_t^{(a)}=\\mathbb E_{X,Z}[g_{\\beta_0}(m_t^{(a)}+\\sqrt{v_t^{(a)}}Z,a,X)^2]\\), \\(m_{t+1}^{(a)}=\\mu_t^{(a)}\\), and \\(v_{t+1}^{(a)}=\\sigma^2\\kappa_t^{(a)}+\\tau^2\\)",
